## Project

This is a full-stack FYP Management System. Full spec is in INSTRUCTIONS.md.
Always read INSTRUCTIONS.md before starting any task.

## Code Style

- Use async/await, never callbacks
- Always wrap controllers in try/catch
- Standard API response: { success, data, message }
- Use HTTP status codes correctly (200, 201, 400, 401, 403, 404, 500)
- Never return password fields in API responses

## Sequelize

- Always use associations (hasMany, belongsTo) — never raw JOIN queries
- Never write raw SQL with user input

## React

- Use React Hook Form + Zod for all forms
- Use TanStack Query for all server state
- Never use useEffect to fetch data

## Security

- Every route except /api/auth/\* must verify JWT
- Always validate file type and size on upload
- Never expose .env values to the frontend

## General

- Comment complex business logic
- Ask before making architectural decisions not covered in INSTRUCTIONS.md
